8. She once camped in the jungle for three months and decided never to camp again. (Verbatim: "I camped in the jungle for three months and decided to never do that again")

9. She dislikes badgers and finds them scary. (Verbatim: "no badgers are scary and no no i don't like badgers no no no no not the same")

